ed, and service, documents, authentication, CRUD-related write/delete behavior, firewall access, and locking recovered. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agree with the executor evidence.","limitations":["Some credential-bearing command text and the post-restart tokenless/token-bearing PUT status values were redacted. Successful explicit assertions and the unredacted pre-restart lock test provide strong corroboration.","Lifecycle snapshots are bounded inventories and do not provide a comprehensive file or package delta; the retained /tmp/anon.body is directly visible, but other uncaptured minor residue cannot be excluded."]}
